# No Git LFS in this repository, deliberately.
#
# The whole tree is ~11 MB with a 3.5 MB largest file, so LFS would buy nothing
# and would cost every cloner an extra dependency plus a bandwidth quota. The
# only genuinely large artifacts are the trained model weights, and those are
# published as GitHub Release assets instead — see scripts/fetch_models.sh.

# Keep line endings sane for firmware sketches and shell scripts.
*.ino text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf

# Treat binary assets as binary so git does not attempt to diff them.
*.usd  binary
*.usda binary
*.stl  binary
*.pgm  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
